        "content": "## 4. De-duplicate, log & route\nUpsert by subsidy ID so weekly runs never duplicate, then route: strong gets an alert plus a kickoff draft, possible goes to review, no-fit is logged only, unclear is flagged."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
